A Material Badge paints its own pill, so a Style's background drawn by the
Modifier was a rectangle behind it and the pill stayed the theme's error red:
a row of colored badges was all red. Its colors are Compose's arguments,
`containerColor` the Style's background and `contentColor` its color, and
the Modifier draws no background.

deny out/kotlin/android/app/src/main/java/test/sngl/app/MainScreen.kt `Badge\(modifier = Modifier\.background` -- the pill takes the color, not a rectangle behind it

-- m.sngl --
import ui "sngl:ui"

output {
